#
# Declarative structural assertions for the notation slice — the
# slice-resident test-DSL twin of the asserted-TBox MUST / MUST-NOT invariants
# formerly hand-written in tests/test_notation.py. Each assertion runs as a
# SPARQL ASK over the notation module graph (gmeow:scopeModule) under the
# native Rust harness (crates/slicetest).
#
# Notation is migrated, so class stereotypes are logic:
# (logic:Kind, logic:SubKind, logic:AbstractIndividualType, logic:QualityValue),
# not gufo:.
#
# RETAINED in pytest (not migratable here):
#   test_language_is_sibling_not_subclass_of_symbolic — gmeow:Language is a
#     subject defined in another slice; a scopeModule cell would miss it.
#   (The former gmeow:WritingSystem / gmeow:FormalLanguage sibling-vs-notation
#    checks are retired: scripts are lang:Script and the formal-language kind is
#    lang:formalLanguageKind, none of which are gmeow:NotationSystem subclasses.)
#   test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (dynamic loop) — the
#     graph.subjects(RDFS.subClassOf, node) sweep over the whole merged graph
#     cannot be expressed as a module-scoped ASK without locking in specific
#     rejected names; the positive class+QualityValue assertions are migrated
#     here as separate cells.
#   test_ambiguous_cases_co_modelable — gmeow:originFormal and
#     gmeow:LanguageOrigin are subjects defined in
#     slices/extensions/languages/module.ttl, not here.
#

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/notation/tests/> .

# --- 1. SymbolicSystem is a logic:Kind under InformationObject (MUST) ----------
ex:saSymbolicSystemIsKind a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:SymbolicSystem a owl:Class , logic:Kind ;
        rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:InformationObject .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:SymbolicSystem MUST be an owl:Class typed logic:Kind and a subclass of gmeow:InformationObject — it is the broad top-level Kind for all convention-bearing symbol systems." .

# --- 2. NotationSystem is a logic:SubKind under SymbolicSystem (MUST) ----------
ex:saNotationSystemIsSubKind a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:NotationSystem a owl:Class , logic:SubKind ;
        rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:SymbolicSystem .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:NotationSystem MUST be an owl:Class typed logic:SubKind and a subclass of gmeow:SymbolicSystem — it narrows the parent Kind to structured, rule-governed notation systems." .

# --- 3. NotationSystemUsage is a subclass of logic:Relator and Observation (MUST) ---
ex:saNotationSystemUsageRelator a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:NotationSystemUsage a owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf logic:Relator ;
        rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:Observation .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:NotationSystemUsage MUST be an owl:Class that is a subclass of both logic:Relator and gmeow:Observation — it is the reified relator that bridges notation use onto the universal observation stack." .

# --- 4. The four NotationSystemUsage roles are ObjectProperty (MUST) ---
ex:saNotationUsageRolesFunctional a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK {
    gmeow:notationUsageTarget           a owl:ObjectProperty .
    gmeow:notationUsageNotationSystem   a owl:ObjectProperty .
    gmeow:notationUsageRole             a owl:ObjectProperty .
    gmeow:notationUsageInterval         a owl:ObjectProperty .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "All four NotationSystemUsage roles MUST be owl:ObjectProperty — the target, notation system, role, and interval bindings are the canonical reification." .

# --- 5. NotationSystem is NOT a subclass of Language (MUST-NOT) ---------------
ex:saNotationSystemNotSubclassLanguage a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:NotationSystem rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:Language . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:NotationSystem MUST NOT be a subclass of gmeow:Language — the boundary is explicit: a notation system lacks independent generative syntax/semantics and is structurally distinct from a language (Principle 9)." .

# --- 6. SymbolicSystemKind is a value-vocabulary subclass of logic:QualityValue (MUST) ---
ex:saSymbolicSystemKindIsValueVocab a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind a owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind MUST be an owl:Class that is a subclass of logic:QualityValue — kinds are an open value vocabulary of individuals, not Entity subclasses (Principle 9)." .

# --- 7. NotationUsageRole is a value-vocabulary subclass of logic:QualityValue (MUST) ---
ex:saNotationUsageRoleIsValueVocab a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:NotationUsageRole a owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:NotationUsageRole MUST be an owl:Class that is a subclass of logic:QualityValue — roles are an open value vocabulary of individuals, not Entity subclasses (Principle 9)." .

# --- 8. symbolicKindStenographic is typed SymbolicSystemKind (MUST) -----------
ex:saSymbolicKindStenographicTyped a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindStenographic a gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindStenographic MUST be typed gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind — stenography is modelled as a notation-domain kind individual, not a language origin." .

# --- 9. symbolicKindStenographic is NOT typed LanguageOrigin (MUST-NOT) -------
ex:saSymbolicKindStenographicNotLanguageOrigin a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindStenographic a gmeow:LanguageOrigin . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindStenographic MUST NOT be typed gmeow:LanguageOrigin — stenography is a shorthand notation for a language, not a language origin value itself (Principle 9)." .

# --- 10. symbolicKindCryptographic is typed SymbolicSystemKind (MUST) ---------
ex:saSymbolicKindCryptographicTyped a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindCryptographic a gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindCryptographic MUST be typed gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind — cryptographic ciphers are notation-domain kind individuals, not language origins." .

# --- 11. symbolicKindCryptographic is NOT typed LanguageOrigin (MUST-NOT) -----
ex:saSymbolicKindCryptographicNotLanguageOrigin a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindCryptographic a gmeow:LanguageOrigin . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindCryptographic MUST NOT be typed gmeow:LanguageOrigin — cryptographic encoding is a transform notation scheme, not a language origin value (Principle 9)." .

# --- 12. symbolicKindTranscription is typed SymbolicSystemKind (MUST) ---------
ex:saSymbolicKindTranscriptionTyped a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindTranscription a gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindTranscription MUST be typed gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind — IPA is a transcription notation system kind individual, not a natural language." .

# --- 13. symbolicKindMathematical is typed SymbolicSystemKind (MUST) ----------
ex:saSymbolicKindMathematicalTyped a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindMathematical a gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindMathematical MUST be typed gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind — mathematical notation is a notation-domain kind individual." .

# --- 14. symbolicKindMathematical is NOT typed LanguageOrigin (MUST-NOT) ------
ex:saSymbolicKindMathematicalNotLanguageOrigin a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindMathematical a gmeow:LanguageOrigin . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindMathematical MUST NOT be typed gmeow:LanguageOrigin — mathematical notation is not inferred as a natural language origin (Principle 9)." .

# --- 15. symbolicKindMusical is typed SymbolicSystemKind (MUST) ---------------
ex:saSymbolicKindMusicalTyped a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindMusical a gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindMusical MUST be typed gmeow:SymbolicSystemKind — musical notation is a notation-domain kind individual." .

# --- 16. symbolicKindMusical is NOT typed LanguageOrigin (MUST-NOT) -----------
ex:saSymbolicKindMusicalNotLanguageOrigin a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK { gmeow:symbolicKindMusical a gmeow:LanguageOrigin . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:symbolicKindMusical MUST NOT be typed gmeow:LanguageOrigin — musical notation is not inferred as a natural language origin (Principle 9)." .

# --- 17. hasNotationSystem property shape (MUST) ------------------------------
ex:saHasNotationSystemProperty a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:hasNotationSystem a owl:ObjectProperty ;
        rdfs:domain gmeow:Language ;
        rdfs:range gmeow:NotationSystem .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:hasNotationSystem MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty with domain gmeow:Language and range gmeow:NotationSystem — the flat unscoped link from a language to its notation system(s)." .

# --- 18. writingSystemAsNotation property shape (MUST) -----------------------
ex:saWritingSystemAsNotationProperty a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:writingSystemAsNotation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
        rdfs:domain lang:Script ;
        rdfs:range gmeow:NotationSystem .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:writingSystemAsNotation MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty with domain lang:Script and range gmeow:NotationSystem — the bridge when a script (lang:Script) doubles as a notation system (Braille, featural scripts)." .

# --- 19. notationSystemKind is a subproperty of symbolicSystemKind (MUST) -----
ex:saNotationSystemKindIsSubproperty a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:notationSystemKind rdfs:subPropertyOf gmeow:symbolicSystemKind . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:notationSystemKind MUST be a subproperty of gmeow:symbolicSystemKind — it is the narrower, intent-revealing form for systems already typed NotationSystem, so the broad symbolicSystemKind query path picks it up transitively." .

# --- 20. SymbolicSystem is grafted onto lang:SignSystem (MUST) ----------------
ex:saSymbolicSystemGraftsSignSystem a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:SymbolicSystem rdfs:subClassOf lang:SignSystem . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:SymbolicSystem MUST be a subclass of lang:SignSystem — the notation graft (Principle 19): a symbolic system IS a sign system in the lang: grounding layer, distinguished by lang:signSystemKind and lang:modality rather than a local class ladder. Grounds the whole symbolic-system family in lang:." .

# --- 21. NotationSystem is grafted onto lang:SignSystem (MUST) ----------------
ex:saNotationSystemGraftsSignSystem a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK { gmeow:NotationSystem rdfs:subClassOf lang:SignSystem . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:NotationSystem MUST be a subclass of lang:SignSystem — the structured-notation subkind is grounded in lang: as a sign system of lang:notationalKind (the notation graft, Principle 19), so the former language-vs-notation boundary survives as a lang:signSystemKind distinction rather than a subclass overlap." .
